# Canonical host: www -> apex, so a page is never indexable at two URLs.
https://www.gochujang.net/*  https://gochujang.net/:splat  301!

# NOTE: there is deliberately no `/* /index.html 200` SPA catch-all here.
#
# Every real route is prerendered to its own index.html by scripts/prerender.mjs,
# so Cloudflare Pages serves each one directly — with its own title, canonical,
# and JSON-LD — and returns a genuine HTTP 404 (via dist/404.html) for anything
# that does not exist, instead of a 200 soft-404 carrying the homepage's tags.
